{"id":2724975102,"name":"🌳Flora Frenzy🌌","desc":"📜Version 2.3.2\r\n\r\n🌱Plant! 🌳Collect! 💰Trade!\r\n🌌83 amazing plants!\r\n\r\nIn Flora Frenzy combine seeds to create new and amazing hybrid plants! Complete the Botany Book and unlock every possible plant combination there is!\r\n\r\n🎉Join the server link below to be a part of the community! Notifications about updates and to contact the developers!","path":"/game/2724975102-flora-frenzy","slug":"2724975102-flora-frenzy","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/e580ae7dea6703a2a9ca0c9d87c8f42f434797f7237de95c8bc6483471d5bd70.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-d2f0f0cf006591c5063c854d11c7742a/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":0,"visitor":2668120,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2025-09-08T17:40:21.242Z","creator":{"name":"M & N Studios","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":1,"freeCount":1,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0},"page":1,"next":null,"total":1,"scripts":[{"slug":"Flora-Frenzy-Water-all-plants-52179","_id":"68bf1505fc8ff7e8331a7780","title":"Water all plants","game":{"_id":"68bf1505fc8ff7e8331a777d","gameId":2724975102,"name":"🌳Flora Frenzy🌌","imageUrl":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/no-game.webp","original":null},"thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/no-game.webp","original":null},"placeId":2724975102},"features":"Auto waters all plants!","tags":["auto","Plant","Flora frenzy","Water"],"script":"while true do\nlocal ReplicatedStorage = game:GetService(\"ReplicatedStorage\")\nlocal WaterPlot = ReplicatedStorage.Remotes.Server:WaitForChild(\"WaterPlot\")\n\nlocal farms = workspace:WaitForChild(\"_Farms\")\n\nfor _, farm in ipairs(farms:GetChildren()) do\n\tif farm:FindFirstChild(\"Zones\") then\n\t\tfor _, zone in ipairs(farm.Zones:GetChildren()) do\n\t\t\tfor _, plot in ipairs(zone:GetChildren()) do\n\t\t\t\tif plot.Name:find(\"Plot\") then\n\t\t\t\t\tlocal success, result = pcall(function()\n\t\t\t\t\t\treturn WaterPlot:InvokeServer(plot)\n\t\t\t\t\tend)\n\n\t\t\t\t\tif success then\n\t\t\t\